    <bpmn:process id="W_W167" name="W167. Store &amp; DC Recycling Program (Circular Economy)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Accumulation of secondary packaging (cartons, plastics, broken pallets)
Frequency: Weekly
Volume: Covers all 200 stores and 4 DCs; ~1–2 tonnes of recyclable material per store/month
Owner: DC Supervisor / Store Manager
Participants: Stock Associates, Logistics Team, DC Supervisor, Recycling Partners, Sustainability Manager
Source: workflow W167 — Store &amp; DC Recycling Program (Circular Economy)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W167_LaneSet5">
