      <bpmn:userTask id="W167_Task7" name="Store and DC associates segregate waste: Carton, Stretch Film (Plastic), Wood…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Store and DC associates segregate waste: Carton, Stretch Film (Plastic), Wood (Pallets), Scrap Metal
Responsible (R): Associates
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W167_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W167_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W167_Task8" name="Materials baled (for carton/plastic) or stacked (for pallets) at DC/Store dock">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Materials baled (for carton/plastic) or stacked (for pallets) at DC/Store dock
Responsible (R): Stock Associate
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W167_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W167_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W167_Task9" name="Reverse Logistics">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Logistics collects recyclables from Stores via Reverse Logistics trucks returning to DC
Responsible (R): Logistics Team
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W167_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W167_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W167_Task10" name="DC consolidates recyclables; sells to accredited recycling partners">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: DC consolidates recyclables; sells to accredited recycling partners
Responsible (R): DC Supervisor
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W167_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W167_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W167_Task11" name="System records &quot;Recycling Revenue&quot; and weight diverted from landfill; feeds…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: System records &quot;Recycling Revenue&quot; and weight diverted from landfill; feeds into W114 Sustainability Report
Responsible (R): DC Supervisor
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W167_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
